---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Page as Web pages<br/>new-report, UploadImages,<br/>profile
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant Points as ActivityPointsService<br/>(proposed)
    participant Profile as ProfileService<br/>(proposed)
    participant DB as Supabase DB<br/>activity_points,<br/>activity_point_values (proposed)

    Note over Steward,DB: Covers US 1.0.5. No points exist in the code today.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Note over Steward,DB: Points for a SIR (AT 1)
    Steward->>Page: Submit a new SIR for a Site
    Page->>Server: addSiteInspectionReport, uploadSiteInspectionAnswers,<br/>insertInspectionAttachments (exist)
    alt Submission fails
        Page->>Server: rollbackSiteInspectionSubmission(responseId) (exists)
        Page-->>Steward: Show error. No points are given
    else Submission succeeds
        Page->>Points: awardActivityPoints('sir_submitted', responseId) (proposed)
        Points->>Points: Read the caller from the session
        Points->>DB: Read form_responses row. Check user_id is the caller. Get site_id
        Points->>DB: Read points for this Site and activity from activity_point_values
        Points->>DB: Insert one row in activity_points<br/>(unique on activity and source id, so a retry does not add twice)
        Page-->>Steward: SIR saved
    end

    Note over Steward,DB: Points for a photo (AT 2)
    Steward->>Page: Choose a photo for a Site in UploadImages
    Page->>Page: POST /api/s3/presign-homepage-images, then PUT the file to S3 (exists)
    Page->>Server: insertHomepageImageUpload(rows) (exists)
    Server->>DB: Insert homepage_image_uploads row (exists)
    Server->>Points: awardActivityPoints('photo_uploaded', uploadId) (proposed)
    Points->>DB: Check the upload row belongs to the caller, then insert one row in activity_points

    Note over Steward,DB: Show the total (AT 3)
    Steward->>Page: Open my profile
    Page->>Profile: getStewardProfile(userId) (proposed)
    Profile->>Points: getActivityPointsTotal(userId) (proposed)
    Points->>DB: Sum points in activity_points for the user
    DB-->>Points: Total
    Points-->>Profile: Total
    Profile-->>Page: Profile with the total
    Page-->>Steward: Show the current total

    Note over Steward,DB: The server reads the user id from the session and the site and points from the database.<br/>The browser does not send a user id or a points value.<br/>Open questions: who sets the points for each Site and activity, the default when<br/>a Site has no value, and if points are removed when a SIR or photo is deleted (US 7.0.5, 7.0.8).
